{"sourceUrl":"https://mse.hit.edu.cn/2026/0728/c20611a398507/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:53.410523+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mse.hit.edu.cn/2026/0728/c20611a398507/page.htm","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span>诚挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我院攻读硕士（博士）学位研究生。为便于推免生申请，具体安排如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span>基本修业年限</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>我院硕士研究生基本修业年限</span><span>3</span><span>年，直博生基本修业年限</span><span>5</span><span>年。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>2.</span></strong><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）在满足我校接收推免生的相关要求基础上，毕业专业应为：材料科学与工程及物理、化学、机械、化工、计算机、数学、力学等相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）所有推免生均需参加我院接收专业方向的面试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）其他要求（与学校</span></span><span>要求相同</span><span>）</span></p><p><strong><span>3.</span></strong><strong><span>审核流程</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>根据学校统一工作安排，有意申报我院</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年推免生预选拔的校内外具备推免资格</span><span>的</span><span><span>学生，须登录哈工大研招办官网（</span><span>http://yzb.hit.edu.cn</span><span>），通过学校“推免生信息采集系统”完成预报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）审核时间：申请人在完成预报名后，学院将分两批进行集中审核（或即时审核）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）通知形式：学院将通过预报名系统及电话（或邮件等形式）分批次通知学生审核通过情况，并视报名情况对面试做出具体安排。</span></span></p><p><span>具体通知时间：</span></p><p><span><span>第一批：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日前</span></span></p><p><span><span>第二批：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日前</span></span></p><p><span>（以上时间节点为预计时间，可能会根据工作情况进行调整。）</span></p><p><strong><span>4.</span></strong><strong><span>考核安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）学院<span>推免生信息采集系统</span>关闭时间为</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日。考核时间将在审核通过后，根据报名情况尽快安排。考核形式、地点以通知为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）面试所需其他材料与提供方式：</span></span><span>申请者在填报报名志愿的同时将所需申请材料发送至我院各专业联系人邮箱，申请材料（</span><span>文件命名格式：姓名</span><span>－</span><span>选报学科方向</span><span>－</span><span>毕业院校</span><span>）包括：本科成绩单、专业成绩排名证明原件并加盖有教务处或院系公章、各类证书、</span><span><span>体现英语水平的证明材料（</span><span>CET4/CET6/TOEFL/GRE/IELTS</span><span>成绩等）</span></span><span><span>、申请者个人简历（一页</span><span>A4</span><span>纸）等材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span></span><span>报考直博生的推免生须征得报考导师的</span><span>同意</span><span><span>并提供两封专家推荐信（下载附件</span><span>1</span></span><span>）。</span></p><p><strong><span>5.</span></strong><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>各学科方向联系方式及材料提交邮箱</span></strong><strong></strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>序号</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>学科方向</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>Email</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>电话</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>光电信息科学与工程</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>王老师</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>20250047@hit.edu.cn</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>18245023301</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>材料物理与化学</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>刘老师</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>liusj0817@hit.edu.cn</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>15244620969</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>材料与器件空间环境效应科学与技术</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>刘老师</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>liuy@hit.edu.cn</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>13359709637</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>材料学</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>安老师</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>anqi1993@hit.edu.c</span></strong><strong><span>n</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>18800427075</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>凝固科学与工程</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>王老师</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>wangqi_hit@hit.edu.cn</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>18846123687</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>塑性加工</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>徐老师</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>hitforming@163.com</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>13946170420</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>7</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>焊接（含电子封装）</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>林老师</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>YZhitjoining@163.com</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>18846038270</span></strong><strong></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span>6.</span></strong><strong><span>其他</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）所有考生（包括本校应届本科毕业生）均须通过</span><span>“</span><span>推免生信息采集系统</span><span>”</span><span>进行报名，如报名专项计划，请在报名时先选择专项计划名称，再选择学院及专业。学院接收计划完成后，将不再接收未在系统中报名的考生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）全国推免服务系统开通后，将根据接收计划、报名情况等依照考核结果从高到低顺序确定录取名单。取得所在学校推免生资格且报考我院的上述校内外推免生，在规定时间内，登录全国推免服务系统完成网上录取确认。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p>学院联系人：杨老师</p><p>联系电话：0451-86413945</p><p>郑州高等研究院 (郑州基地) 联系人：仝老师0371-61680822</p><p>苏州高等研究院 (苏州基地) 联系人：朱老师15136820485</p><p>重庆研究院（重庆基地）联系人：周老师18845165869</p><p>辽宁材料实验室联系人：哈老师15114166090</p><p><span>其他未尽事宜按学校相关文件及规定执行。</span></p><p><span>                  </span><span>   </span><span><span>      </span><span>  </span></span><span>哈尔滨工业大学材料科学与工程学院</span></p><p>2026年7月28日</p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mse.hit.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://mse.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/a4/3d/b4bb2cac46f2946bcbfca1eb2dc6/2bd6abee-ffc7-47c7-9344-56da53e8371b.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1.报考直博生的专家推荐信.doc</a></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"1dc892daf2673fee2690bb6c097287af1d2425470dafa91491db7078ffbd1aa0","textLength":1493,"sourceSha256":"7995a79648ab8e705ad380f38514f1956ac8b8517ebe1f0a364dc078b1c166be","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-43c546495f1ef8d5fdad","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学材料科学与工程学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:53.410523+00:00"}
